  FirstName: Luka
  LastName: Tsereteli
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Schoolchild
  CharacterDescription: Ten years old, nervous, avoids eye contact
  CharacterArc: Small and perpetually anxious, Luka filled out the checkpoint form twice because he wasn't sure the first one counted. He lives on the fourth floor of Block C with his mother. His father is in Varka for work and hasn't called in a week. School closed without warning and no one explained when or if it would reopen. He isn't old enough to understand everything that is happening, but he is old enough to know that the adults around him are scared, and that they are trying very hard not to show it.
  DateOfBirth: 11/04/1979
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 30 OCT
